iso_interior.js draws the pieces docs/design/town.md E gives the new buildings: & anvil,
< furnace (glow, flame, sparks), > rack (swords, spear, shield; clothes rail in a boutique,
tool pegboard in a shop), | lectern with an open book, ; specimen case (a pickled hell-beast
whose eye follows the room), : stove with a stew pot (a bubbling cauldron in a lab),
' standing mirror, ` training dummy (drawn in any theme, so the dojo yard can use it).
Styles office forge tavern shop boutique dojo lab lobby, with log, stone, tile,
half-timber and paper-screen walls; tavern taps, shop till and potion case, lobby
mailboxes and bench, office map table. Poses sweep hammer stir carry fish water knit wave.
sprites.js npcLook takes a full hero look, so indoor hosts can be pandas, penguins, frogs.

